      "cooked": "<p>Inventory reconciliation. The valuation rate automatically changes to the default value registered for the item, even if I enter a different value in the field.</p>\n<p>________________________-<br>\nBefore saving the inventory reconciliation, I want the value of this item to be equal to the current valuation rate, which is 10.88. This is how it’s currently filled in:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5c72601ace11b64f538dac1493fd892a12106d6b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5c72601ace11b64f538dac1493fd892a12106d6b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c72601ace11b64f538dac1493fd892a12106d6b_2_690x340.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dbOYtGC8NJcJtNjlSP9uiRfW4qf\" width=\"690\" height=\"340\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c72601ace11b64f538dac1493fd892a12106d6b_2_690x340.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c72601ace11b64f538dac1493fd892a12106d6b_2_1035x510.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5c72601ace11b64f538dac1493fd892a12106d6b_2_1380x680.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1C1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1597×788 57.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>After saving the edits made in the draft, the value automatically reverts to 14.75, even though I typed 10.88. This value is the one registered in the item’s settings.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/6/f6a01e533e806f603b7148fc10fd51ef866ddcd7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f6a01e533e806f603b7148fc10fd51ef866ddcd7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6a01e533e806f603b7148fc10fd51ef866ddcd7_2_690x357.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zbKvCdVi8fMIHg3SLqi9SdOUYBN\" width=\"690\" height=\"357\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6a01e533e806f603b7148fc10fd51ef866ddcd7_2_690x357.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6a01e533e806f603b7148fc10fd51ef866ddcd7_2_1035x535.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/6/f6a01e533e806f603b7148fc10fd51ef866ddcd7_2_1380x714.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1D1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1648×853 74.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>____________________________</p>\n<p>Version</p>\n<p>“frappe”: “15.99.0”, \t“erpnext”: “15.96.1”</p>\n<p>Installation: docker - compose</p>",
